To IMPROVE THIS PIC :

Big part have to be with letters
*  8 Tsuka => A Tsuka
* ... => B (Handle) part from 13 to 16)
* 22 sori => C Sori
* 28 Mono-Uchi => D Mono-Uchi
* 20 Saya => E Saya

And for each part, number have to be in order :
* A Tsuka => 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7 menuki
* B (handle) => 1, 2, 3, 4 habaki
* C Sori => [1, 2, 3, 4 Nagasa/ 5 Shinogi, 6, 7 Ji, 8 Yokote]
* D Mono-Uchi => [1 Ha, 2 Hasaki, 3, 4]
* E Saya => 1 koigucchi, 2, 3, 4, [E-saya], 5 kojiri

